  "prefLabel": "Adm 211.01 Standard and Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 211.01 Standard and Burden of Proof. A party or intervenor claiming that an action or inaction of the agency is invalid, improper or contrary to law shall bear the burden of proving that proposition by a preponderance of the evidence, unless another standard or burden is imposed by law.\n\nSource. #8908, eff 9-22-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm200.html"
